<title>SWEDEN: SCA to sell Tambrand products in France.</title>
<headline>SCA to sell Tambrand products in France.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry products company Svenska Cellulosa Aktiebolaget SCA said on Friday its Molnlycke unit would sell Tambrands products in France.</p>
<p>&quot;SCA Molnlycke and Tambrands have agreed that SCA Molnlycke would sell Tampax tampons in France from May 1, 1997,&quot; SCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>SCA Molnlycke brands Nana and Libra were already sold in France, it said.</p>
<p>&quot;The agreement between SCA Molnlycke and Tambrands will lead to more effective distribution for both companies...Similar agreements have been set up in Britain and Russia,&quot; SCA said.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1003</p>
</text>
